### Register a new user
POST {{lms_url}}/lms/v1/auth/register
accept: application/json
X-Organisation: tenant_namespace_1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "SwanhtetAungphyo",
  "email": "swan100222@gmail.com",
  "password": "SwanHtet12@",
  "address": "Swan Krakow",
  "phoneNumber": "+48608422691",
  "mfaVerificationOption": true
}

