### SetUp MFA
POST {{lms_url}}/lms/v1/auth/setup-mfa
accept: application/json
X-Organisation: tenant_namespace_1
Content-Type: application/json

{

  "domain_email": "swan100222@tenant_namespace_1.edu"
}

